<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>BILLPATRON | Your Bills. Someone's Generosity.</title>

<meta name="description" content="BILLPATRON connects people facing financial difficulties with compassionate sponsors who help settle essential bills.">

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">

</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">
        <span>🛡️</span>
        <div>
            <h2>BILLPATRON</h2>
            <small>Your Bills. Someone's Generosity.</small>
        </div>
    </div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#recipients">Recipients</a>
        <a href="#donors">Donors</a>
        <a href="#plans">Plans</a>
        <a href="#login">Login</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section id="home" class="hero">

    <h1>Your Bills.<br>Someone's Generosity.</h1>

    <p>
        A platform where compassion meets responsibility.
        We connect individuals facing financial difficulties
        with people willing to make a meaningful difference.
    </p>

    <a href="#register" class="button">
        Get Started
    </a>

    <a href="#donors" class="button secondary">
        Become a Donor
    </a>

</section>

<section id="about">

    <h2>About BILLPATRON</h2>

    <p>
        BILLPATRON is a bill-sponsorship platform designed
        to connect individuals experiencing financial hardship
        with compassionate sponsors.
    </p>

    <p>
        Recipients can submit essential bills for verification,
        while donors can browse verified requests and contribute
        directly to the relevant service providers.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Mission</h3>

    <p>
        To make essential services more accessible through
        transparency, generosity and responsible sponsorship.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Core Values</h3>

    <p>
        Integrity | Transparency | Generosity |
        Accountability | Compassion
    </p>

</section>

<section id="recipients">

    <h2>For Bill Recipients</h2>

    <p>
        Are you struggling to settle an essential bill?
        BILLPATRON gives you an opportunity to submit your
        request for consideration by compassionate sponsors.
    </p>

    <h3>Supported Bill Categories</h3>

    <ul>
        <li>Electricity bills (KPLC)</li>
        <li>Water bills</li>
        <li>House rent</li>
        <li>School fees</li>
        <li>Hospital and healthcare bills</li>
        <li>Internet bills</li>
        <li>Other essential bills</li>
    </ul>

    <a href="#register" class="button">
        Register as Recipient
    </a>

</section>

<section id="donors">

    <h2>For Sponsors and Donors</h2>

    <p>
        Your generosity can change someone's circumstances.
        Discover verified essential bill requests and help
        individuals and families meet their obligations.
    </p>

    <p>
        Donors pay the relevant service providers directly.
        BILLPATRON facilitates the connection and verification
        process.
    </p>

    <a href="#register" class="button">
        Join as a Donor
    </a>

    <p><strong>Donor membership is free.</strong></p>

</section>

<section id="plans">

    <h2>Recipient Membership Plans</h2>

    <p>Choose a membership plan that suits your needs.</p>

    <div class="plans">

        <div class="plan">
            <h3>FREE</h3>
            <h2>KSh 0</h2>
            <p>Basic membership</p>
            <button onclick="selectPlan('FREE')">
                Choose Plan
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="plan">
            <h3>SILVER</h3>
            <h2>KSh 299</h2>
            <p>Monthly membership</p>
            <button onclick="selectPlan('SILVER')">
                Choose Plan
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="plan featured">
            <h3>GOLD</h3>
            <h2>KSh 599</h2>
            <p>Monthly membership</p>
            <button onclick="selectPlan('GOLD')">
                Choose Plan
            </button>
        </div>

        <div class="plan">
            <h3>PLATINUM</h3>
            <h2>KSh 999</h2>
            <p>Monthly membership</p>
            <button onclick="selectPlan('PLATINUM')">
                Choose Plan
            </button>
        </div>

    </div>

    <p>
        Membership does not guarantee financial sponsorship.
        All requests are subject to verification and consideration.
    </p>

</section>

<section id="register">

    <h2>Create Your Account</h2>

    <form id="registerForm">

        <input
            type="text"
            name="fullName"
            placeholder="Full Name"
            required
        >

        <input
            type="email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="Email Address"
            required
        >

        <input
            type="tel"
            name="phone"
            placeholder="Phone Number"
            required
        >

        <input
            type="password"
            name="password"
            placeholder="Create Password (minimum 8 characters)"
            minlength="8"
            required
        >

        <button type="submit">Create Account</button>

        <p id="registerMessage"></p>

    </form>

</section>

<section id="login">

    <h2>Member Login</h2>

    <form id="loginForm">

        <input
            type="email"
            name="email"
            placeholder="Email Address"
            required
        >

        <input
            type="password"
            name="password"
            placeholder="Password"
            required
        >

        <button type="submit">Login</button>

        <p id="loginMessage"></p>

    </form>

</section>

<section id="payment">

    <h2>Subscription Payment</h2>

    <p>
        Payments are currently made through
        Pochi la Biashara.
    </p>

    <h3>Payment Number</h3>

    <h2>+254797181531</h2>

    <p>
        After making payment, submit your transaction
        code through your member account.
    </p>

    <p>
        Membership activation is subject to payment verification.
    </p>

</section>

<section id="founder">

    <h2>Founder's Message</h2>

    <p>
        BILLPATRON was founded with the belief that
        generosity should be organised, transparent
        and meaningful.
    </p>

    <h3>Joseph Maina Ndiritu</h3>

    <p>Founder & Founder Director, BILLPATRON</p>

</section>

<footer>

    <h2>BILLPATRON</h2>

    <p>Your Bills. Someone's Generosity.</p>

    <p>
        Integrity. Transparency. Compassion.
    </p>

    <p>
        © 2026 BILLPATRON. All Rights Reserved.
    </p>

    <p>Kenya | Building a Global Community of Generosity</p>

</footer>

<script src="/script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
